WEBVTT

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:01.611
the United States and Russia,
tension abated,

00:02:01.635 --> 00:02:03.507
we started dismantling nuclear weapons,

00:02:03.531 --> 00:02:06.554
and they started to become
a relic of the past.

00:02:07.177 --> 00:02:10.329
Generations didn't have to grow up
with the specter of nuclear war

00:02:10.353 --> 00:02:11.558
hanging over their heads.

00:02:13.367 --> 00:02:16.884
And there other reasons people don't like
to think about nuclear weapons.

00:02:16.908 --> 00:02:19.358
It's scary, overwhelming.

00:02:19.382 --> 00:02:20.725
I get it.

00:02:20.749 --> 00:02:23.916
Sometimes I wish I could have chosen
a cheerier field to study.

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:24.986
(Laughter)

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:27.240
Perhaps tax law would
have been more uplifting.

00:02:27.264 --> 00:02:28.755
(Laughter)